<speak>
<s>This is your Jumu'ah briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">26062026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>A single projectile near Oman struck the tanker Ever Lovely, and within hours the United Nations suspended its escort scheme through the Strait of Hormuz.</s> <s>Iran's Revolutionary Guards now declare that only vessels on their approved coastal route receive safe passage, and tankers have begun reversing course mid-transit.</s> <s>Benchmark oil rose two percent... and whether one narrow waterway reprices the world's shipping may rest on the next sixty days.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Ahmed Al-Raqab, eleven years old, was killed carrying a watermelon when Israel struck a tent camp sheltering displaced families at Al-Mawasi.</s> <s>A six-year-old beside him lost an eye, and his grandfather bled through his shirt.</s> <s>A United Nations inquiry has concluded Israel deliberately targeted children — and the people in those tents had already survived famine, displacement, and war.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>West Bengal's chief minister has accused a former mayor of approving a defective warehouse design for cash back in January.</s> <s>Eleven people died when that building collapsed on Wednesday, and police have filed culpable homicide charges against five, including three municipal engineers.</s> <s>The document that should have protected those workers was a transaction — and that is how corruption becomes a body count.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Armed gangs in Haiti have begun striking displacement camps far beyond Port-au-Prince, pursuing the very people who fled them.</s> <s>Controlling the national highways, these groups inflict kidnapping, sexual assault, and arson as the state cedes territory it can no longer hold.</s> <s>More than one and a half million Haitians remain displaced inside their own country, and flight no longer offers them safety.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Ukraine has bombed the Krasnodar fuel depot twice in two weeks, crippling Russia's refining capacity until Moscow leans on Belarusian refineries to keep its forces supplied.</s> <s>President Zelensky says Ukraine will escalate these deep strikes, forcing Russia to pull its air defences back to protect the capital.</s> <s>The Kremlin denies pressuring Minsk to host drone launchers — though Lukashenko already shelters two thousand Russian troops and nuclear weapons.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The United States Supreme Court has shielded Monsanto from an entire category of cancer lawsuits in a seven-to-two ruling.</s> <s>Federal pesticide law, the court held, pre-empts state claims that Roundup failed to warn of risk, because its federal label carries no cancer warning.</s> <s>Bayer still faces thousands of pending suits, and the cost of harm now shifts back onto the people who were exposed.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Peter Thiel has followed Javier Milei's deregulation drive to Argentina, and one investigation reads the move less as tax flight than as a geopolitical bet.</s> <s>The country sits on lithium and critical minerals, and stripping away regulation removes the legal barriers that once blocked foreign control of those resources.</s> <s>The report frames a sovereign economy treated as a laboratory — a sandbox where capital tests what a deregulated state can offer.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The European Union has ratified the Turnberry pact, suspending four billion dollars in retaliatory duties and ending the long Boeing-Airbus dispute.</s> <s>In exchange, the United States keeps a fifteen percent tariff on most European goods, and the terms expire at the end of twenty twenty-nine.</s> <s>Brussels calls it stability... though it has accepted a tariff it spent years fighting to avoid.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Washington has barred the electric carmaker Polestar from American sales beginning in twenty twenty-seven, under a ban targeting vehicles linked to China.</s> <s>Though Polestar wears Swedish branding, its owner is the Chinese group Geely, while its sister brand Volvo was cleared separately.</s> <s>The company will sell its remaining stock and pivot abroad, as connected cars become the next front in the technology rivalry.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Alice Springs endured twenty days above forty degrees Celsius in a single month, and remote First Nations communities are absorbing that heat with the least adapted housing in Australia.</s> <s>Extreme heat is never felt equally — it concentrates on those with the fewest resources to cool down.</s> <s>Researchers warn the lasting damage falls on people who had no role in causing it, and who are rarely consulted on the response.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>More than three thousand glacial lakes now fill Pakistan's northern mountains, swollen by melting ice, and thirty-three of them are classified as highly vulnerable.</s> <s>When an ice dam breaks, a lake can release millions of cubic metres of water within hours, sweeping away the valleys below.</s> <s>The United Nations has installed two hundred eighty-four sensors as outbursts climb, yet the country did almost nothing to cause the warming now bearing down on it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers in London have built a carbon-capture electrode that ran stably for fifty hours, generating alkalinity right at its surface rather than in a bulk solvent.</s> <s>That shift makes the units modular and far cheaper to regenerate than the amine-scrubbing methods that dominate the field.</s> <s>The system ran at ten times the previous current density, though it remains early laboratory work, not deployment.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Japanese researchers have found that soil acidity governs the gut bacteria that rice stink bugs need to survive.</s> <s>By shifting the pH of their fields, farmers across Asia could suppress pest outbreaks without reaching for a single chemical.</s> <s>The findings, published in the journal Microbiome, still need field trials before any farmer can put them to use.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Southeast Asia's largest economy has no single cyber authority that actually functions, even as regional partners build their response plans around one.</s> <s>The agency named on Indonesia's org chart does not match who holds power on the ground, leaving a gap no institution owns.</s> <s>Cyber resilience is an institutional problem before it is a technical one — and a fragmented chain of command is precisely what an adversary exploits.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Astronomers working from Rome have measured filaments of cosmic matter stretching beyond three billion light-years.</s> <s>Standard cosmology predicts the universe should smooth out and become uniform at such vast scales, yet these structures are far larger than the model allows.</s> <s>The researchers call the discrepancy highly significant, a signal that may point toward physics we do not yet understand.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The investigative group Bellingcat has trained a model to rank fifty-four thousand Telegram posts by the likelihood they show civilian harm.</s> <s>Built on two and a half thousand verified incidents from Russia's invasion of Ukraine, the tool lets researchers verify evidence rather than spend their hours hunting for it.</s> <s>Bellingcat is releasing the code freely, so others documenting conflict, anywhere, can do the same.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>